					"speakerTitle": "太郎丸"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210102,
					"content": "怎麼是太郎丸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 727210104,
					"content": "之前聽安彥太郎說，第四位武者是因為手頭有點緊才來參加比試的，看來太郎丸的目標也是獲勝者的禮金。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210105,
					"content": "雖然有點不好意思，可在錢這件事上，我是不會讓步的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210106,
					"content": "嗚汪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "太郎丸"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210107,
					"content": "汪汪，汪汪汪汪！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210108,
						727210109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "太郎丸"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210108,
					"content": "太郎丸的叫聲變大了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210110
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 727210110,
					"content": "#太郎丸，這可是堂堂正正的比試，禮金應該屬於你和{NICKNAME}之中武藝更強的那個。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210111,
					"content": "不過如果我們贏了的話，也可以給你買點好吃的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210112,
					"content": "汪，汪汪汪汪汪，汪汪汪！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210115,
						727210113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "太郎丸"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210115,
					"content": "雖然聽不懂，但是來吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210116
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 727210116,
					"content": "汪！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "太郎丸"
				},
				{
					"id": 727210113,
					"content": "雖然聽不懂，但我還需要準備一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						727210114
					]
				},
				{
